{"id":"2f6d414affafe82d","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-inductive.md","title":"Inductive Set","display":"df-inductive — Inductive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-inductive","aliases":["58-df-inductive"],"display":"df-inductive — Inductive Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-inf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-inductive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-inductive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive — Inductive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"828011acc1ee6ac5\" href=\"?note=828011acc1ee6ac5\" title=\"58-ax-inf\">58-ax-inf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,X_0,x\\in V\">\\(X,X_0,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:V\\to V\">\\(S:V\\to V\\)</span> (von Neumann successor operator defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (inductive-set predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}(X_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}(X_0)\\)</span> (a chosen inductive set, whose existence follows from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"828011acc1ee6ac5\" href=\"?note=828011acc1ee6ac5\" title=\"58-ax-inf\">58-ax-inf</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}successor} \\vdash S(x)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}successor} \\vdash S(x)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\leftrightarrow \\emptyset\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(S(x)\\in X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\leftrightarrow \\emptyset\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(S(x)\\in X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\omega\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X_0:\\forall Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(Y)\\to x\\in Y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\omega\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X_0:\\forall Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(Y)\\to x\\in Y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every inductive set contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; it does not by itself generate the full von Neumann hierarchy.</li>\n<li>The construction is made inside an explicitly chosen inductive set. Separation therefore produces a set, and the result is independent of the chosen <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0\">\\(X_0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Under the von Neumann convention, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\)</span> is the smallest inductive set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-inf","status":"resolved","id":"828011acc1ee6ac5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-inf]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-inf","status":"resolved","id":"828011acc1ee6ac5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}(X_0)$ (a chosen inductive set, whose existence follows from [[58-ax-inf]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,X_0,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}(X_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}successor} \\vdash S(x)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{x\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\leftrightarrow \\emptyset\\in X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(S(x)\\in X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\omega\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X_0:\\forall Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(Y)\\to x\\in Y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"d55ca90b9e3ac1b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the inductive-set predicate from [[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]."},{"id":"b02eb3a45a036bc3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}$（归纳集谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-675","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md|58-df-inductive]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["828011acc1ee6ac5"]}